,{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"row","children":[{"type":"text","value":"row"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../../index/type-aliases/Row.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Row"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const expanded = row_getIsExpanded(row)","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"function-row-getisexpanded","text":"Function: row_getIsExpanded()","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"row","text":"row","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Function: row\\_getIsExpanded()\n\n```ts\nfunction row_getIsExpanded<TFeatures, TData>(row): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-expanding/rowExpandingFeature.utils.ts:348](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-expanding/rowExpandingFeature.utils.ts#L348)\n\nChecks whether this row is expanded.\n\n`options.getIsRowExpanded` can override state-derived behavior. Otherwise\nthe row is expanded when expanded state is `true` or contains this row id.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### row\n\n[`Row`](../../index/type-aliases/Row.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst expanded = row_getIsExpanded(row)\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: row_getIsExpanded\ntitle: row_getIsExpanded\n---\n\n# Function: row\\_getIsExpanded()\n\n```ts\nfunction row_getIsExpanded<TFeatures, TData>(row): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-expanding/rowExpandingFeature.utils.ts:348](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-expanding/rowExpandingFeature.utils.ts#L348)\n\nChecks whether this row is expanded.\n\n`options.getIsRowExpanded` can override state-derived behavior. Otherwise\nthe row is expanded when expanded state is `true` or contains this row id.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../../index/interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](../../index/type-aliases/RowData.md)\n\n## Parameters\n\n### row\n\n[`Row`](../../index/type-aliases/Row.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst expanded = row_getIsExpanded(row)\n```\n"}
